  "description": {
   "value": "You may not know me. But if like most Indians you love a good deal, we've probably spoken. You see, I'm one of Swiggy's 4508 customer care representatives. I was hired to answer a whole bunch of questions regarding your orders. But on most days, the most common DM my colleagues and I find waiting on our social media pages is, \"Bhai, koi discount dede\" or \"Any good discountsssss?!!!!\" or... you get the drift. Truth be told, the job's getting just a wee bit monotonous. You know the feeling. You wake up, you get dressed (the top half, at least), you power on your laptop, and you know exactly what's waiting for you. Which is why we're putting out this ad to let you know that we indeed have good discounts on Swiggy. Up to 60% off, in fact, from some of the top brands in the city. I hope you like all the offers we've got lined up for you. And I hope the next time we speak, we can talk about something else. Like, the weather perhaps?",
